# Robinhood Chain launchpad (placeholder brand "stockpad") - the meowstock /
# squidpad product and design on Robinhood Chain (chainId 4663). Coins pair a
# tokenized stock; the 1% pool fee splits 50/40/10 holders/creator/platform.
# Copy to .env.robinhood.local and build:
#   VITE_BRAND=robinhood npx vite build --mode robinhood

VITE_BRAND=robinhood
VITE_PROTOCOL=stable-v3
VITE_FEE_MODE=creator
VITE_REWARD_MODE=dollar

# Chain - Robinhood Chain
VITE_CHAIN_ID=4663
VITE_CHAIN_NAME="Robinhood Chain"
VITE_RPC_URL=https://rpc.mainnet.chain.robinhood.com
VITE_EXPLORER_URL=https://robinhoodchain.blockscout.com
VITE_MULTICALL3=0xcA11bde05977b3631167028862bE2a173976CA11
VITE_NATIVE_SYMBOL=ETH

# StableLaunchpadFactory deployment (contracts/deployments/robinhood-launchpad-v3.json)
VITE_FACTORY_ADDRESS=0xDaE6C39084485B88b457Da4F9446C9aEAd94D0eB
VITE_TOKEN_DEPLOYER_ADDRESS=0x73d18E06007CD8Bfc7ae7731e1F4c5DCD57CA5DF

# Uniswap V3 SwapRouter02 + WETH (18-dec wrapped native, doubles as quote).
VITE_SWAP_ROUTER=0xCaf681a66D020601342297493863E78C959E5cb2
VITE_QUOTE_ASSET=0x0Bd7D308f8E1639FAb988df18A8011f41EAcAD73
VITE_WETH_ADDRESS=0x0Bd7D308f8E1639FAb988df18A8011f41EAcAD73
VITE_QUOTE_DECIMALS=18
VITE_QUOTE_IS_WNATIVE=true
VITE_POOL_FEE_TIER=10000
VITE_START_BLOCK=52351355

# This RPC accepts multi-million block address-scoped getLogs ranges.
VITE_LOGS_WINDOW=5000000
VITE_SCAN_SPAN=5000000

VITE_API_URL=
VITE_WS_URL=

VITE_WALLETCONNECT_PROJECT_ID=e1bda672d5deb56579fe084dddfb9174

# DexScreener does not index Robinhood Chain; leave empty.
VITE_DEXSCREENER_CHAIN=
VITE_RH_OFFICIAL=
